{
  "name": "Long-Eared Striker",
  "desc": "A Volkodlak that typically hides its slender body beneath a cloak to operate covertly.\\nIt is said that long ago, the artisans of the Golden Acropolis, who had mastered the power of creation, forged the bodies of the fae for various purposes, and this particular type of Volkodlak was originally created to test the limits of reproduction.\\nHowever, following the catastrophic blow that reduced even that kingdom of citrinitas to Ruins, the long-eared tribe survived to the present day due to their vast numbers.\\nNow, they are the masters of their own bodies. Moreover, their agility, allowing them to move nimbly even in the snow, makes them a threat that those crossing the snowfields must approach with caution.",
